<%# The hub, "Pont de commandement" (DESIGN.md: Kicker, Menu item, Showcase,
    Daily booster panel, Set progress row, Signed-out hub; EXPERIENCE.md,
    Hub content). Desktop: the kicker, menu and daily booster panel on the
    left, the showcase in the centre, the set progress on the right (from
    1180px; under it in the left column). Phone: one column without the
    menu, the tab bar navigating. A visitor sees the same menu and an
    invitation instead of the showcase, without the daily booster panel,
    which a player keeps once the day's booster is collected (the
    countdown to the next one). The daily claim's Turbo Stream answer
    replaces the panel, the packs chip, menu 01 and the empty showcase's
    action (bonus_arc_controller.ts flies the canister). A contributor whose
    goal reward pack waits unopened gets the reward toast, which a browser
    shows once per week's reward.
    Never served from Turbo's cache; the packs chip's countdown refreshes it
    by morphing, keeping the scroll. The LIVE ticker fills the layout's
    ticker slot, and the public goal stream replaces the goal panel as the
    periodic sum moves it. %>
<% turbo_exempts_page_from_cache %>
<% turbo_refreshes_with method: :morph, scroll: :preserve %>
<% content_for :ticker do %>
  <%= render "shell/ticker", items: @ticker %>
<% end %>
<div class="hub" data-controller="hub-menu" data-hub-menu-focus-first-value="<%= flash[:signed_in].present? %>">
  <header class="hub__kicker">
    <h1 class="hub__title" tabindex="-1" data-hub-menu-target="heading"><%= t(".kicker.title") %></h1>
  </header>

  <%= render "pages/menu", bank: @bank, collection: @collection, friends_online: @friends_online %>

  <% if current_player %>
    <span hidden data-controller="bonus-arc" data-action="turbo:before-stream-render@document->bonus-arc#render"></span>
  <% end %>

  <% if @goal_reward_week %>
    <% content_for :toasts do %>
      <%= render ToastComponent.new(title: t(".goal_reward.title"), message: t(".goal_reward.message"), once: "goal-reward-#{@goal_reward_week.iso8601}") %>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>

  <% if current_player.nil? %>
    <%= render "pages/invitation" %>
    <%= render "pages/goal", goal: @goal %>
  <% else %>
    <%= render "pages/showcase", card: @showcase, bank: @bank, repostable: @showcase_repostable %>
    <%= render "pages/goal", goal: @goal %>
    <%= render "pages/daily_booster", bank: @bank, primary: @showcase.present? if @bank[:bonus_collectable] || @bank[:bonus_collected] %>
  <% end %>

  <%= render "pages/set_progress", sets: @sets if @sets.any? %>
</div>
<%= turbo_stream_from(*LiveStream.goal_streamables) %>
